  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CE12320",
    "sub_id": "00768",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>書面報告：50% , 口頭報告:&nbsp; 50%</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Written report: 50%, Oral report: 50%</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "1.閱讀IEEE Spectrum近三年之科技報導, 製作投影片依序於課堂中上台導讀.\n2.上課時需專心聆聽他人的導讀並完成學習單上傳\n3.上課時不可從事其他與課程無關之事務",
    "course_pol_en": "1. Read the technology reports of IEEE Spectrum in the past three years, and make slides to introduce them in class.\n2. During class, you need to listen attentively to other people’s readings and complete the upload of study sheets.\n3. It is not allowed to engage in other matters unrelated to the course during class",
    "course_rem": "1.每次導讀時間25~30分鐘。並解說專有名詞。\n2.每週均須完成課程導讀學習單。",
    "course_rem_en": "1. Each guided reading lasts 25 to 30 minutes. and explain proper nouns.\n2. The course introduction worksheet must be completed every week.",
    "ais_meno": "<ul>\n\t<li>學生須於規定時間內親自完成各項書面及口頭報告</li>\n\t<li>修課學生使用相關資料(包含文字及圖表)須明確加註引用來源,&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>相關書籍文獻使用時, 須遵守著作權規定.</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<ul>\n\t<li>Students must complete various written and oral reports in person within the specified time (學生須於規定時間內親自完成各項書面及口頭報告)</li>\n\t<li>Students taking the course must clearly cite the source when using relevant materials (including text and graphics). (修課學生使用相關資料(包含文字及圖表)須明確加註引用來源)&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>When using related books and documents, copyright regulations must be followed. (相關書籍文獻使用時, 須遵守著作權規定)</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
